  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 23574ed9632300d42b18b44c929116ff, type: 3}
  m_Name: Choices dialouge
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  EnemyResponses:
  - choiceType: 8
    Responses:
    - If you want it, come and take it.
    - "You\u2019re not scaring me. Not today."
    - "I\u2019ve fought worse than you and I\u2019m still here."
    - My supplies stay with me. Over my dead body.
    - "I\u2019m done running. Let\u2019s settle this right now."
    - "You\u2019re not walking away with a damn thing."
    - "One of us isn\u2019t leaving here. And it won\u2019t be me."
    - "I\u2019ve lost too much already. You won\u2019t take more from me."
    - "You think I\u2019m weak? Wrong day, wrong guy."
    - "You\u2019re not the first to try this, and you won\u2019t be the last to fail."
    - "I don\u2019t care if I die here\u2026 but you\u2019re coming with me."
    - Supplies can be replaced. You? Not so easily.
    - "I\u2019ve been waiting for a fight. Thanks for volunteering."
    - "You don\u2019t realize it yet, but you just made a mistake."
  - choiceType: 1
    Responses:
    - "Yeah, nope! I\u2019m out"
    - "Oh hell no, I\u2019m out of here!"
    - "Forget this\u2014I\u2019m outta here!"
    - Gotta get out of here!
    - Move, move, move!
    - "I\u2019m not stopping for anything!"
    - Keep up if you can!
    - "Can\u2019t let them catch me!"
    - "I\u2019m not losing this!"
    - "Hold on, I\u2019ve got this!"
    - "No way you\u2019re getting this!"
    - Outta my way!
    - Not today, not ever!
    - Not letting go!
    - "I can make it\u2026 I have to!"
    - "Keep running\u2026 just keep running!"
    - "Can\u2019t stop\u2026 can\u2019t stop!"
    - "Ha! You\u2019ll have to do better than that!"
    - Too slow, buddy!
    - "Is that all you\u2019ve got?"
    - Missed me! Try again!
    - "You\u2019ll need faster legs than that!"
    - You really thought you could catch me?
    - Better luck next time!
  - choiceType: 2
    Responses:
    - I hope you can sleep guilt free knowing how you rob from poor soul.
    - "Hope that makes you feel powerful\u2026 jerking stuff from someone who had
      no choice."
    - "Take it\u2026 enjoy it while it lasts."
    - "You\u2019re proud, aren\u2019t you? Good luck keeping it."
    - "Don\u2019t think this makes you strong\u2026 it just makes you pussy."
    - "I never thought it would end like this\u2026"
    - "I hope it was worth it\u2026 because it cost me everything. My kid, my wife.
      everything."
    - "If this is survival\u2026 I don\u2019t want it."
    - "Everything I had\u2026 just left behind."
    - "I\u2019ll leave it here\u2026 it doesn\u2019t matter anymore."
    - "I\u2026 I have no choice\u2026 just\u2026 take it."
    - "I can\u2019t fight\u2026 take it and leave me alone."
    - "It\u2019s yours\u2026 just\u2026 leave me be."
    - "Here\u2026 take it. Happy now?"
    - "Go on\u2026 it\u2019s yours. Not like I needed it."
    - "Fine\u2026 enjoy your prize."
    - "It\u2019s just stuff\u2026 whatever."
    - "Take it. Doesn\u2019t mean anything."
    - "There\u2019s nothing I can do\u2026 take it."
    - "I guess it\u2019s over\u2026 just\u2026 take it."
    - "All gone\u2026 nothing left for me."
    - "Do what you want\u2026 I\u2019m powerless here."
    - "I have no fight left\u2026 it\u2019s yours."
    - I am just a dead man walking. Might as well do a charity before i die.
  - choiceType: 4
    Responses:
    - "I was hoping you\u2019d ask!"
    - "Sure! I\u2019ll stick with you."
    - "Alright, let\u2019s do this together!"
    - "Yeah, I\u2019d be happy to join."
    - "Sure thing. Let\u2019s see what we can do.\""
    - "I guess I\u2019ll join. Don\u2019t expect me to talk much."
    - "I\u2019ll go\u2026 but I\u2019m not promising much."
    - "If you insist\u2026 I\u2019ll join."
    - "Alright. But I\u2019m only coming along for now."
    - "Alright. But I\u2019m only coming along for now."
    - "Thank you\u2026 I could use someone by my side."
    - "I\u2019ll go with you\u2026 I\u2019ve been alone too long."
    - "I\u2019ve been looking for a reason to keep going\u2026 this works."
    - "I don\u2019t know if I can say no\u2026 let\u2019s do this."
    - "No time to waste. Let\u2019s move."
  - choiceType: 16
    Responses:
    - "Oh yeah? That\u2019s cute. How about you drop your supplies and walk away
      before I change my mind."
    - "Oh, you think you\u2019re in a position to bargain? Funny. Here\u2019s the
      deal: you give me everything, and maybe you keep breathing."
    - "Oh, I hear you\u2026 but I\u2019ve got a better idea. You leave all your gear
      here, and you leave with your life."
    - "Oh, sure\u2026 sounds nice. But you know what sounds nicer? You handing me
      your pack before things get ugly."
    - "Oh, I get it, you\u2019re trying to play nice. I used to fall for that. Not
      anymore. Empty your bag."
    - "Oh, bargains? We tried that once. Trusted a guy\u2014he shot my cousin and
      took everything. So here\u2019s how this one goes: drop your supplies and run,
      before I put you in the ground too."
    - Oh yeah? Supplies. Now.
    - "Oh, that\u2019s adorable. You think you\u2019ve got a choice. Only choice
      you\u2019ve got is how fast you drop your pack."
    - "Oh, I\u2019ve heard that before. You know what comes next? A knife in the
      back. Not this time. Give me your gear."
    - "Oh, I don\u2019t want to argue. I don\u2019t even care what you said. I just
      want your supplies."
    - Ahhhh.. how about you hand over your stuff before I stop laughing.
    - "Oh, I used to talk like you. Believed in deals, in helping each other out.
      Then one winter, a man traded me canned food\u2014turned out they were empty
      tins, sealed with rocks. My brother starved. So forgive me if I don\u2019t
      bargain anymore. Drop your supplies, now."
    - "Oh, you sound just like the last guy. You know where he is now? Probably shambling
      around as one of them. You don\u2019t wanna join him\u2014so leave the bag
      and walk."
    - 'Oh yeah? How about this: your supplies, or your blood. Your choice.'
    - "Oh, I get it\u2026 I really do. But you don\u2019t understand\u2014I need
      what you\u2019ve got. My sister\u2019s sick. I can\u2019t let you walk away
      with food while she wastes away. Drop the bag\u2026 please, just drop it."
    - "Oh, sure, sure\u2026 I hear you. But here\u2019s the thing\u2014I don\u2019t
      care. Supplies. All of them. On the ground. NOW!"
    - "Oh yeah? You think you\u2019re the first who came talking about fairness?
      I had a group once\u2014we trusted a stranger. He waited till night, slit our
      throats in our sleep, took everything. I lived. They didn\u2019t. So forgive
      me if I don\u2019t play nice. Supplies, or else."
    - Oh. Cute speech. Supplies, now.
    - "Oh\u2026 I hate doing this. Once upon a time I would\u2019ve shared. But kindness
      doesn\u2019t keep you alive out here. Supplies. Please."
  - choiceType: 32
    Responses:
    - "Join you? No thanks. I don\u2019t trust strangers with my back."
    - "I used to run with people. Watched every single one of them get eaten alive.
      I\u2019m not making that mistake again."
    - "Join you? Ha! You\u2019d slow me down. I survive just fine on my own."
    - "Look at me\u2026 I can barely walk. I\u2019d just be dead weight to you."
    - "That\u2019s exactly what a raider would say before stabbing me in the night.
      Not falling for it."
    - "Can\u2019t. Got a kid hidden nearby. My job\u2019s keeping them safe, not
      running around with you."
    - "What\u2019s the point? Gropu, no group\u2026 it all ends the same. In teeth
      and screams."
    - Why me? You want me as bait or something? No deal.
    - "If you\u2019d found me a month ago, maybe. But now\u2026 I don\u2019t have
      the strength left."
    - The last squad I joined left me to die. You want me to do that again? Forget
      it.
    - "The Lord put me here, alone. That\u2019s how I\u2019ll stay."
    - "Join you? Sure\u2014right up until I end up on your dinner plate when rations
      run dry."
    - "I don\u2019t need numbers. Numbers get noticed. I move like a shadow. That\u2019s
      how I\u2019m still alive."
    - "You\u2019ve got your path, I\u2019ve got mine. Don\u2019t cross them again."
    - "I\u2019ve got business of my own. Things you don\u2019t need to know. So no,
      I won\u2019t join you."
    - "Where were you last winter, when I was starving in a cellar? You didn\u2019t
      help me then. I don\u2019t need you now."
    - "oin you? Ha! I barely survive with me, myself, and I. That\u2019s already
      three mouths to feed."
    - "Every time I trusted someone, they took from me\u2014supplies, hope, even
      my dog. Trust is gone. So am I."
    - "I\u2019ve lost enough people already. If I don\u2019t get close, I don\u2019t
      get hurt."
    - "Your squad means more mouths, more noise, more risk. Doesn\u2019t sound like
      survival to me."
    - "I\u2019ve made it this far without help. Don\u2019t insult me by offering
      pity."
    - "Last time I joined a group, they tied me up and left me for the dead. So no,
      I\u2019m good."
    - "The world\u2019s over. Being in group don\u2019t change that. I\u2019ll take
      my chances alone."
    - "I don\u2019t have time for your little pop band. I\u2019m looking for someone.
      Until I find them, nothing else matters."
    - "You seem decent. But trust takes more than a five-minute chat. I\u2019ll stay
      on my own for now."
  - choiceType: 64
    Responses:
    - "Not today. I\u2019ve got places to be."
    - "You look like trouble. I\u2019ll pass."
    - I travel alone. Always have.
    - "Sorry, stranger. Can\u2019t stick around."
    - "I don\u2019t trust anyone anymore\u2026 goodbye."
    - Thanks for the chat. But I walk my own path.
    - "I\u2019ve lost enough people already. Don\u2019t want to lose more."
    - So long. Stranger.
    - "Don\u2019t follow me. I move faster alone."
    - "I don\u2019t need a squad. I just need to survive."
    - "You seem decent. That\u2019s why I\u2019m leaving before it goes bad."
    - "Stick to your fight. I\u2019ll stick to mine."
    - Nothing personal. Just safer this way.
    - You want company. I want distance.
    - "I\u2019ve walked with people before. Didn\u2019t end well."
    - The more people, the louder the noise. No thanks.
    - "Stay safe, stranger. I\u2019ll take my chances elsewhere."
    - "Your group sounds nice. But I don\u2019t do \u2018nice\u2019 anymore."
    - "Don\u2019t take it wrong. I just don\u2019t stay put."
    - "I\u2019m not cut out for groups. Never was."
    - "One step closer to people, two steps closer to death. I\u2019ll walk away."
    - "You\u2019ve got your path. I\u2019ve got mine. Mine doesn\u2019t stop here."
    - "Trust is expensive. I can\u2019t afford it."
    - "We\u2019ve both survived this long apart. Let\u2019s keep it that way."
    - I leave before ties get heavy. This is goodbye.
